pro_course_detail.description:
Ce cours est conçu pour les étudiants, jeunes diplômés et professionnels souhaitant réussir leurs entretiens d’embauche dans un contexte international ou bilingue.

Les séances peuvent être réalisées :
en anglais ;
en français ;
ou dans un format bilingue français/anglais selon le niveau et les besoins de l’élève.

Fort de plus de 25 ans d’expérience dans des environnements professionnels exigeants et internationaux, je suis habitué à conduire des entretiens, évaluer des candidats et accompagner des professionnels dans leur préparation aux recrutements et aux échanges professionnels à fort enjeu.

Le contenu du cours est personnalisé à partir de votre CV et de la description du poste visé (job description) afin de préparer des réponses adaptées aux attentes du recruteur et de travailler sur des situations concrètes liées à votre secteur d’activité.

L’objectif du cours est de développer :
la fluidité à l’oral ;
la confiance en entretien ;
la capacité à répondre de manière professionnelle et naturelle ;
ainsi que les techniques pour gérer le stress et les questions difficiles.

Le cours s’appuie sur des mises en situation réalistes inspirées de véritables processus de recrutement.

This lesson focuses on developing practical communication skills in English through speaking, listening, and everyday vocabulary. Students will engage in interactive activities to improve their conversational fluency, pronunciation, and confidence in real-life situations. The lesson also covers essential grammar, vocabulary, and expressions needed for general English use, enabling learners to communicate effectively in daily scenarios such as greetings, shopping, travel, and social interactions. It aims to enhance both spoken and written English, making learners more comfortable and capable in a variety of social and practical contexts.

Key Topics Covered:

Conversational skills and strategies;
Common expressions and phrases for daily life;
Listening comprehension exercises;
Basic grammar and sentence structures;
Vocabulary building for everyday situations;
Role-playing and conversational practice;
Tips for effective communication.

Learning Outcomes:
By the end of this lesson, students will be able to:

Engage confidently in everyday conversations in English;
Use appropriate vocabulary and expressions in different social situations;
Improve pronunciation and listening skills;
Apply basic grammar correctly in speech and writing;
Communicate more effectively in both casual and formal contexts.

This comprehensive Portuguese course welcomes learners of every level, from beginners to advanced speakers, and supports diverse language objectives. Whether you want to learn basic survival phrases for travel, improve your conversational skills, or achieve full fluency, this class is designed to adapt to your needs. Through dynamic lessons, cultural insights, and interactive practice, students will develop their speaking, listening, reading, and writing skills. Personalized learning activities ensure steady progress, helping you reach your specific goals—whether it’s communicating confidently in daily situations, preparing for exams, or using Portuguese professionally.

Key Topics Covered:

Fundamental vocabulary and grammar;
Pronunciation and conversational practice;
Reading, writing, and listening exercises;
Cultural aspects of the Portuguese-speaking world;
tailored content based on individual goals (e.g., travel, business, academic);
Interactive activities for speaking and comprehension.

Learning Outcomes:
By the end of this course, students will be able to:

Communicate effectively in various everyday situations;
Understand and produce basic to advanced Portuguese in speaking and writing;
Gain cultural insights that enhance language learning;
Achieve personal goals whether conversational fluency, professional proficiency, or academic mastery;
Confidently engage with Portuguese media, travel, or work environments.

